Package: libpdfium-qore148-0
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PDF rendering library for Qore (Chromium milestone 148)
 PDFium renders PDF pages and extracts text, with system font, color,
 compression and Unicode libraries. JavaScript, XFA and Skia are disabled.
 This package exposes PDFium's C API with a milestone-specific SONAME;
 internal C++ dependencies are private to the library.

Package: libpdfium-qore-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libpdfium-qore148-0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for Qore's PDFium library
 C headers, the linker symlink and pkg-config metadata for the PDFium
 rendering library used by the Qore PDF module.
